{"config":{"lang":["en"],"separator":"[\\s\\-]+","pipeline":["stopWordFilter"]},"docs":[{"location":"","title":"GitHub API Documentation","text":"<p>Welcome to the documentation for the GitHub REST API.</p> <p>This guide provides clear and concise examples of how to interact with GitHub's API using HTTP requests.</p>"},{"location":"#available-sections","title":"Available Sections","text":"<ul> <li>Authentication</li> <li>Repositories</li> <li>Issues</li> <li>Users</li> </ul>"},{"location":"authentication/","title":"Authentication","text":"<p>To interact with the GitHub API, you need to authenticate using a personal access token.</p>"},{"location":"authentication/#basic-example","title":"Basic Example","text":"<pre><code>GET /user\nHost: api.github.com\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR-TOKEN\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"authentication/#response","title":"Response","text":"<pre><code>{\n  \"login\": \"octocat\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"name\": \"The Octocat\"\n}\n</code></pre> <p>\ud83d\udc49 Replace <code>YOUR-TOKEN</code> with your actual GitHub token.</p>"},{"location":"issues/","title":"Issues","text":"<p>Create, list, or update issues for a repository.</p>"},{"location":"issues/#create-a-new-issue","title":"Create a New Issue","text":"<pre><code>POST /repos/{owner}/{repo}/issues\nContent-Type: application/json\nAuthorization: Bearer YOUR-TOKEN\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"issues/#example-request-body","title":"Example Request Body","text":"<pre><code>{\n  \"title\": \"Bug: Unexpected logout\",\n  \"body\": \"I was logged out after 5 minutes of inactivity.\",\n  \"labels\": [\"bug\"]\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"issues/#response","title":"Response","text":"<pre><code>{\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"title\": \"Bug: Unexpected logout\",\n  \"state\": \"open\"\n}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"repositories/","title":"Repositories","text":"<p>Work with public or private repositories using these endpoints.</p>"},{"location":"repositories/#list-repositories-for-a-user","title":"List Repositories for a User","text":"<pre><code>GET /users/{username}/repos\nHost: api.github.com\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"repositories/#example","title":"Example","text":"<pre><code>GET /users/octocat/repos\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"repositories/#sample-response","title":"Sample Response","text":"<pre><code>[\n  {\n    \"id\": 1296269,\n    \"name\": \"Hello-World\",\n    \"full_name\": \"octocat/Hello-World\"\n  }\n]\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"users/","title":"Users","text":"<p>Retrieve profile and user data.</p>"},{"location":"users/#get-a-user","title":"Get a User","text":"<pre><code>GET /users/{username}\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"users/#example","title":"Example","text":"<pre><code>GET /users/octocat\n</code></pre>"},{"location":"users/#response","title":"Response","text":"<pre><code>{\n  \"login\": \"octocat\",\n  \"id\": 1,\n  \"bio\": \"Just a friendly octopus\"\n}\n</code></pre>"}]}